9. UPDATES AND TELEMETRY

   The Software may check Official Channels for updates and, if the
   corresponding setting is enabled, transmit anonymous usage statistics
   as described in the project README. Both behaviors can be disabled in
   the Software's settings. The Software also downloads language packs
   from Official Channels when You ask for one, and again after an
   update for a language You have already chosen unless update checking
   is switched off. The project README lists the services the Software
   contacts.

